#. module: product_template_attribute_value_xmlid
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_template_attribute_value_xmlid
msgid ""
"=======================\n"
"Attribute Value XML IDs\n"
"=======================\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:fdec833460da026c1c5e41298152df57ef0efcbb741b5718a833b6d1e4b4ad35\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-LGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-GetFluvo%2Faddons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/tree/20.0/product_template_attribute_value_xmlid\n"
"    :alt: GetFluvo/addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"This module gives every ``product.template.attribute.value`` record a\n"
"predictable XML ID, so that product variants can be referenced in\n"
"imports and integrations without looking up database ids.\n"
"\n"
"When Odoo creates a template attribute value, the module adds an XML ID\n"
"``product_template_attribute_value.<template>_<value>``, where:\n"
"\n"
"- ``<template>`` is the name of the XML ID of the product template;\n"
"- ``<value>`` is the name of the XML ID of the attribute value.\n"
"\n"
"Characters other than letters, digits and underscores are replaced by\n"
"``_``.\n"
"\n"
"No XML ID is generated when the template or the attribute value has no\n"
"XML ID (the result would not be predictable), or when the name is\n"
"already used by another record; the latter is logged as a warning.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"Product variants are built from ``product.template.attribute.value``\n"
"records: one per attribute value on a product template (for example\n"
"*Size: L* on a *Desk Organizer*). Odoo gives these records no XML ID, so\n"
"imports and integrations have to look them up by database id, which\n"
"differs between databases.\n"
"\n"
"With a predictable XML ID, extra prices, exclusions and variant\n"
"combinations can be imported and synchronized with external systems by\n"
"reference.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"XML IDs are generated automatically when attribute values are added to a\n"
"product template.\n"
"\n"
"To generate the XML IDs of records that existed before the module was\n"
"installed:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Sales > Products > Product Template Attribute Values*.\n"
"2. Click *Generate XML IDs* above the list.\n"
"\n"
"All template attribute values without a generated XML ID get one, if\n"
"their template and attribute value have an XML ID.\n"
"\n"
"Known issues / Roadmap\n"
"======================\n"
"\n"
"- This module might result in unpredictable behaviour when used with\n"
"  enterprise module ``product_barcodelookup``.\n"
"\n"
